# Where the data lives.
#
# Unset (the default) means a local SQLite file at data/app.db, which is
# created and migrated on first query - so `pnpm dev` needs no setup at all.
#
# Turso's Vercel integration injects TURSO_DATABASE_URL and TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN,
# and the app reads those directly, so a deployment needs nothing set by hand.
# Pull them down for local work with:
#
#   npx vercel env pull .env.local
#
# KITAAB_DB_URL / KITAAB_DB_TOKEN override them, which is how a script points
# somewhere else for a single command.
#
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://<database>-<org>.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=<token>
#
# A remote database is never migrated implicitly. Apply the schema on purpose:
#
#   pnpm db:push
